    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Property Team Lappin Estates take great pleasure in presenting no. 11 Phibsborough to the market. Number 11 is a spacious Pre’63 investment property set out in 3 self-contained apartments comprising of 1 x 4 bedroom , 1 x 2 bedroom with a study/office and 1 x 2 bedroom apartment. \r\nThis is an excellent opportunity to acquire a lucrative investment, situated in the heart of Phibsborough and offers an excellent Investment Opportunity to the astute investor. The current permissible rent is circa €73,000 with potential to increase the rent to circa €85,000 - €90,000 subject to terms. The property is brought to the market with vacant possession. \r\nThis is a busy and accessible location with easy access of M50, Dublin Airport and City Centre!!! \r\nThis location could not be more central with exceptional range of facilities on your doorstep, including restaurants, cafes, hotels and leisure facilities. Public transport is well catered for with LUAS passing close by which in turn connects you with the DART, mainline rail, and local and national bus connections.\r\nThe accommodation briefly comprises 1 x 4 bedroom duplex apartment, 1 x two bedroom duplex apartment with office/study and 1 x 2 bedroom duplex apartment.  Outside there are 3 laundry rooms.  Viewing is very highly recommended!"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "Entrance Hall\t\tTiled floor\r\nApartment 1)\t\t4 Bedroom duplex apartment.\r\nHall\t\tWooden flooring\r\nLiving Room\t\tWooden flooring, coved ceiling, centre rose and feature open fireplace.\r\nKitchen/Dining Room\t4.00m x 3.82m\tTiled floor, dado rail, modern wall and floor mounted units.  Plumbed for washing machine and dishwasher with door to the garden.\r\nUpstairs\r\nLanding\t\t\r\nBedroom 1)\t3.05m x 2.14m\tFitted wardrobe\r\nBedroom 2)\t2.75m x 2.15m\tFitted wardrobe\r\nBedroom 3)\t3.15m x 3.00m\tFitted wardrobe and whb\r\n\r\nBedroom 4)\t3.25m x 3.10m\tFitted wardrobe and whb\r\nBathroom\t\tShower, WC and whb\r\nApartment 2)\t\t2 Bedroom duplex apartment\r\nKitchen/Dining Room\t\r\n5.20m x 3.30m\t\r\nFloor mounted units and part tiled walls.\r\nUpstairs\r\nLanding\t\t\r\nBedroom 1)\t3.40m x 2.18m\tFitted wardrobe\r\nBedroom 2)\t4.20m x 2.10m\tFitted wardrobe\r\nBathroom\t\tShower, WC and whb\r\nInner Hall\t\tAccess to rear garden\r\nApartment 3)\t\t2 Bedroom duplex apartment with study\r\nKitchen/Dining/\r\nLiving Room\t\r\n5.75m x 3.65m\tWooden flooring, modern wall and floor mounted units and part tiled floor.  Door to rear garden.\r\nUpstairs\r\nLanding\t\t\r\nBedroom 1)\t3.00m x 2.55m\tWardrobe and whb\r\nBedroom 2)\t3.43m x 2.20m\tWardrobe and whb\r\nBathroom\t\tShower, WC and whb\r\nHome Office\t2.85m x 2.25m\twhb\r\nOutside\t\t3 Laundry rooms\r\n\r\nNegotiator:\tPaul Lappin Office:  01 8825730   Mobile: 087 236 5880 \r\n\r\nViewing:\tViewing by appointment with Property Team Lappin Estates \r\n\t\r\nCALL 01 8825730 TO HAVE YOUR HOME VALUED FOR FREE"
